{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n喜茶首家喜茶 Gelato Lab+ 選址觀塘APM，於最近11月13日正式開幕了！Gelato Lab+提供8款口味gelato，將喜茶經典的茶飲及人氣元素轉化成gelato版本，包括芒果糯米飯、Tiramisu、葡萄巴斯克、水泥黑芝麻、莓莓生乳希臘煉乳等等。雪糕每天新鮮製作，製作時加入 1–4°C 低溫靜置熟成步驟，令水果和牛奶更加融合，口感更絲滑綿密～開幕首週末已經吸引了很多人排隊，大家對哪個口味有興趣呢？\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322577064486_2227419486afad43a2fef3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322577064486_2227419486afad43a2fef3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322812187772_6230731916afad43c7cb8a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322812187772_6230731916afad43c7cb8a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322990434796_4862028496afad43e4c121.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482322990434796_4862028496afad43e4c121.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948232318154753_8593486026afad4403b3eb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948232318154753_8593486026afad4403b3eb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482323383974033_18878358726afad44245fd6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482323383974033_18878358726afad44245fd6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482323535083839_10482182286afad443b9373.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179482323535083839_10482182286afad443b9373.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Dfy7uhQknZr/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T10:16:31.585989+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T10:00:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T11:30:39.295283+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T10:09:54.289892+00:00","content_hash":"dc753c654d58c012b88bd898e3a0fe0f6df916f0c021f0d994936d71eb2f2213","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}